@title Command search: "wire numbers" runs a command, not the lesson of that name
@area Command search
# Click test C-03: Ctrl+K "wire numbers" plus Enter opened the lesson "Wire Numbers and the Wire List" and replaced the project view. A lesson now leads only when asked for ("lesson ..."); the command comes first and the lesson stays in the list.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text wire numbers
wait 8
shot search-rows
expect "Wire Numbers and the Wire List"
key Enter
wait 20
shot after-enter
expect_not "Wire Numbers and the Wire List"
check_layout
